                <pb facs="0781" n="687" sameAs="frus:frus1924v02/pg687"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.5231/362</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Spain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Moore</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1924-04-27"><hi rendition="#italic">April 27,
                        1924</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received May 13.]</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: In confirmation of my cable No. 23, of
                    April 27, 11 A.M.,<anchor n="9" xml:id="d597-f1"/> I have the honor to report
                    that the date of expiration of the Commercial Agreement of August 1, 1906<anchor
                        n="10" xml:id="d597-f2"/> has been postponed for one year, or until May 5,
                    1925. This postponement has been accomplished by an exchange of Notes between
                    the Spanish Foreign Office and this Embassy (Foreign Office Note No. 40, of
                    April 26th, and the Embassy’s Note No. 146, of today’s date), copies and
                    translations of which are herewith enclosed. The present prorogation was
                    procured under exactly the same conditions as the prorogation agreed to by the
                    exchange of Notes between this Embassy and the Foreign Office of October 6th and
                    23d [<hi rendition="#italic">22d</hi>], 1923.<anchor n="11" xml:id="d597-f3"
                    /></p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Alexander P.
                    Moore</hi></signed></closer>




                <xi:include href="d597-a1.xml" xpointer="d597-a1"/>
                <xi:include href="d597-a2.xml" xpointer="d597-a2"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
